# U18: FolderListControl (the Save As popup's folder picker, Build.lua:1481) alone in a popup:
# double click opens a folder, DELETE on a non-empty folder, the path control goes back.
#! u18-setup folders
screen 1280 800 dpi 1.0
fixture userdir=user1
frames 2
#! expect-text Leagues
move 500 260
click LEFTBUTTON
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
#! expect-text Settlers
move 500 260
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
press DELETE
frames 2
#! expect-text The folder is not empty.
press RETURN
frames 1
move 440 236
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
